<title>JAPAN: JGB futures end sharply higher in thin trade.</title>
<headline>JGB futures end sharply higher in thin trade.</headline>
<text>
<p>*Key December Japanese government bond (JGB) futures end sharply up in technical trade, driven higher by dealers' short-covering. *Traders said rise was exaggerated by thin turnover. *Some small-lot buying by investors detected in cash JGBs.</p>
</text>
